WEBVTT

video-title-preparation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Kukonzekera

equipment
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Mufunika gauze, thonje, katoni, pensulo, kapu, pepala lomata ndi lumo.

video-title-eye-pad
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Pangani chophimba chofewa cha diso

cotton
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Popanga chophimba chofewa cha diso, yalani thonje kuti likhale ngati dzira, mulifupi masentimita asanu mpaka asanu ndi limodzi.

gauze
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Pindani gauze kuzungulira thonje.

pad-tape
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Matani mbali yotseguka ndi tepi.

trim
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Dulani m'mphepete mwa gauze motsatira kaonekedwe ka thonje.

finished-pad
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.000
Ichi ndi chophimba chofewa cha diso.

video-title-eye-shield
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Pangani chotetezera diso cholimba

cardboard
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Popanga chotetezera diso cholimba, pezani katoni waukhondo. Katoni wochokera m'phukusi la zipangizo zachipatala ndi woyenera.

draw
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Gwiritsani ntchito kapu monga chitsanzo pojambula bwalo lokhala ndi mulifupi pafupifupi masentimita asanu ndi atatu.

cut
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Dulani bwalolo.

slit
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Kenako dulani mzere kuchokera m'mphepete mwa bwalo kufika pakati pake.

cone
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Pindani katoni kuti ukhale ngati koni, ndipo mangirirani ndi tepi yomata.

finished-shield
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Ichi ndi chotetezera diso cholimba.
